---
// Serial execution: interactive transactions idle on the network; a stored procedure keeps the single core busy.
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
---
<figure class="txse">
  <div class="txse-scroll">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 900 330" role="img" aria-label="Two panels. Left, interactive transaction: the client sends one query, the server waits for the next across the network, so the single thread sits idle. Right, stored procedure: the client sends the whole transaction once, and the single core runs transactions T1, T2, T3 back to back with no idle gaps.">
    <text x="20" y="26" class="h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Why serial engines want the whole transaction up front</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Vì sao engine chạy tuần tự cần nhận cả transaction ngay từ đầu</tspan>
    </text>
    <rect x="20" y="44" width="430" height="270" rx="6" class="txse-panel is-bad" />
    <text x="36" y="70" class="sec is-bad"><tspan data-lang-en>Interactive: one query at a time</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Tương tác: mỗi lần một câu truy vấn</tspan></text>
    <DiagramIcon name="laptop" x={70} y={116} size={32} />
    <DiagramIcon name="server" x={400} y={116} size={32} />
    <text x="70" y="148" class="note" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>app</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>app</tspan></text>
    <text x="400" y="148" class="note" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>one core</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>một core</tspan></text>
    <path d="M100,102 L366,102" class="txse-arrow" /><polygon points="374,102 366,98 366,106" class="txse-head" />
    <text x="235" y="96" class="note" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>query 1</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>query 1</tspan></text>
    <path d="M370,124 L104,124" class="txse-arrow" /><polygon points="96,124 104,120 104,128" class="txse-head" />
    <text x="235" y="140" class="note" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>result 1</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>kết quả 1</tspan></text>
    <rect x="40" y="170" width="390" height="40" rx="4" class="txse-box is-bad" />
    <DiagramIcon name="hourglass" x={66} y={190} size={22} />
    <text x="92" y="195" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>the core waits while the app thinks</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>core chờ trong lúc app xử lý</tspan></text>
    <path d="M100,236 L366,236" class="txse-arrow" /><polygon points="374,236 366,232 366,240" class="txse-head" />
    <text x="235" y="230" class="note" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>query 2</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>query 2</tspan></text>
    <text x="235" y="278" class="b" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Most of the time is round trips, not work</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Phần lớn thời gian là chờ qua mạng, không phải làm việc</tspan></text>
    <text x="235" y="298" class="note" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>so a single thread would crawl</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>nên một thread đơn sẽ rất chậm</tspan></text>

    <rect x="470" y="44" width="410" height="270" rx="6" class="txse-panel is-ok" />
    <text x="486" y="70" class="sec"><tspan data-lang-en>Stored procedure: send it all once</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Stored procedure: gửi trọn một lần</tspan></text>
    <DiagramIcon name="laptop" x={516} y={116} size={32} />
    <DiagramIcon name="server" x={846} y={116} size={32} />
    <text x="516" y="148" class="note" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>app</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>app</tspan></text>
    <text x="846" y="148" class="note" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>one core</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>một core</tspan></text>
    <path d="M546,116 L812,116" class="txse-arrow is-ok" /><polygon points="820,116 812,112 812,120" class="txse-head is-ok" />
    <text x="681" y="108" class="note" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>the whole transaction</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>cả transaction</tspan></text>
    <rect x="490" y="170" width="370" height="40" rx="4" class="txse-box" />
    <rect x="496" y="176" width="112" height="28" rx="3" class="txse-box is-ok" />
    <rect x="614" y="176" width="112" height="28" rx="3" class="txse-box is-ok" />
    <rect x="732" y="176" width="122" height="28" rx="3" class="txse-box is-ok" />
    <text x="552" y="195" class="b" text-anchor="middle">T1</text>
    <text x="670" y="195" class="b" text-anchor="middle">T2</text>
    <text x="793" y="195" class="b" text-anchor="middle">T3</text>
    <text x="675" y="232" class="note" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>one after another, no waiting between</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>nối tiếp nhau, không chờ giữa chừng</tspan></text>
    <text x="675" y="278" class="b" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Scales with cores only inside one shard</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Chỉ mở rộng theo core khi nằm trong một shard</tspan></text>
    <text x="675" y="298" class="note" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>VoltDB: cross-shard writes drop to about 1,000 per second</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>VoltDB: ghi xuyên shard còn khoảng 1.000 mỗi giây</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>A single-threaded engine is only fast if it never waits. Handing it the whole transaction as a stored procedure removes the waiting, which is why interactive multi-statement transactions are not allowed.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Engine một thread chỉ nhanh khi không bao giờ phải chờ. Đưa cả transaction dưới dạng stored procedure là bỏ được việc chờ, nên transaction nhiều câu lệnh kiểu tương tác không được phép.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .txse { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .txse-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .txse svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .txse text { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .txse .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .txse .sec { font-size: 14.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .txse .sec.is-bad { fill: var(--red); }
  .txse .b { font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .txse .m { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .txse .mono { font-family: var(--font-mono, ui-monospace, monospace); font-size: 12px; }
  .txse .note { font-size: 12px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .txse .note.is-bad { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 600; }
  .txse .note.is-ok { fill: var(--gold-icon); font-weight: 600; }
  .txse .num { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .txse-panel { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .txse-panel.is-bad { stroke: var(--red); }
  .txse-panel.is-ok { stroke: var(--gold); }
  .txse-box { fill: var(--card-bg); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .txse-box.is-bad { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .txse-box.is-ok { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .txse-dot { fill: var(--card-bg); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .txse-arrow { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .txse-arrow.is-bad { stroke: var(--red); }
  .txse-arrow.is-ok { stroke: var(--gold); }
  .txse-dash { stroke-dasharray: 4 4; }
  .txse-head { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .txse-head.is-bad { fill: var(--red); }
  .txse-head.is-ok { fill: var(--gold); }
  .txse-life { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; stroke-dasharray: 4 4; }
  .txse figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.5; }
</style>
